      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Pick up the water spray by performing a palm grab (all fingers curled
        into a fist).\r\nTo spray water onto the plant, uncurl and curl your index
        finger.\r\nTurn the tip of the spray, with your other hand, to adjust the
        spray volume.\r"
